ected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488520">सुन्नुहोस्</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12872_1790611_2020762"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To be unresponsive.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1790611">stop responding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2020762">प्रतिक्रिया दिन रोक्नुहोस्</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12874_276553_488352"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool for accessing right-click menus and targeting small pieces of the interface using touch input.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="276553">touch pointer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488352">टच प्वाइन्टर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12884_1939_486817"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application of the Standard Generalized Markup Language that uses tags to mark elements, such as text and graphics, in a document to 