 an attacker when run.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="268866">malicious software</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488327">मालिसियस सफ्टवेयर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13356_34914_487080"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A standard Windows control that can be used to provide interactive column titles for a list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="34914">column heading</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487080">स्तम्भ शीर्षक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13363_184068_487973"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu option on the Property Panel that enables the user to specify document properties.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="184068">Property Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487973">गुण सम्पादक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1337_297179_488393"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A form of trojan that causes systems equipped with modems to dial phone numbers without the consent of the user. In most cases, the phone numbers dialed are premium rate numbers which result in unexpected charges on the affected user's phone bill.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="297179">dialer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488393">डायलगर्ने</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13370_33049_487061"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To end an application's relationship with an open file so that the application will no longer be able to access the file without opening it again.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="33049">close</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487061">बन्द गर्नुहोस्</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13372_413712_1225384"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A symbol that is displayed beside a paragraph in outline view. You can use the symbol to display or hide subordinate levels of text and to reorganize text quickly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="413712">outline symbol</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1225384">बाह्यरेखा प्रतीक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13374_359204_488780"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A complete Web site stored in a named subdirectory of the top-level Web site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="359204">subsite</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488780">उपसाइट</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13396_2037690_488384"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A proxy server installed by a trojan on a machine providing what appears to be an uninterrupted Internet connection while allowing unauthorized access to an affected machine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2037690">trojan proxy server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488384">ट्रोजन प्रोक्सि सर्भर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13402_41397_487128"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A symbol selected to designate a specific currency.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="41397">currency symbol</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487128">मुद्राप्रतीक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13405_94512_487526"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One or more fields that uniquely identify each record in a table.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="94512">primary key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487526">प्राथमिक की</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13407_121010_1880209"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The way text is displayed in a document, how it behaves and breaks according to settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="121010">text flow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1880209">पाठ फ्लो</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langS