e</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487618">स्थिति</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15055_116265_487618"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The condition at a particular time of any of numerous elements of computing--a device, a communications channel, a network station, a program, a bit, or other element--used to report on or to control computer operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="116265">status</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487618">स्थिति</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15086_5913_486867"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An integrated proofing tool used to search on common words and display synonyms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="5913">thesaurus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="486867">पर्यायकोश</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15088_140956_487794"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control that appears dimmed on a form or data access page. A disabled control cannot get the focus and will not respond to mouse clicks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140956">disabled control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487794">अक्षम बनाइएको नियन्त्रण</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1509_101960_487555"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The likelihood of a computer system or device continuing to function over a given period of time and under specified conditions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="101960">reliability</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487555">विश्वासनीयता</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15094_347947_488760"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control on a form that contains other controls in a table format and that repeats as needed. Users can insert multiple rows when filling out the form.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="347947">repeating table</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488760">दोह्याउने तालिका</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15098_322615_488658"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web site based on the Document Workspace template that workspace members use for discussing, editing, and working together on a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="322615">Document Workspace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488658">कागजात कार्यक्षेत्र</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15098_322615_488813"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web site based on the Document Workspace template that workspace members use for discussing, editing, and working together on a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="322615">Document Workspace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488813">कागजात कार्यक्षेत्र साइट</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15098_361653_488658"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web site based on the Document Workspace template that workspace members use for discussing, editing, and working together on a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="361653">Document Workspace site</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488658">कागजात कार्यक्षेत्र</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15098_361653_488813"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web site based on the Document Workspace template that workspace members use for discussing, editing, and working together on a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="361653">Document Workspace site</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488813">कागजात कार्यक्षेत्र साइट</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1510_264861_488305"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of individual strokes in the Unicode Standard used to compose Chinese/Japanese/Korean (CJK) ideographs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="264861">CJK Strokes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488305">सिजेके स्ट्रोकहरू</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech"