lications requiring a high-end, usually expensive, machine with considerable calculating or graphics capability.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1093171">workstation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2593361">कार्यस्थल</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24039_1097320_2641148"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">On retailer websites, a collection of desired products or items a customer saves to their user account for future reference.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1097320">wish list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2641148">विश लिस्ट</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2405_2020064_2020735"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of battery power left on the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2020064">battery level</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2020735">ब्याटरी चार्ज</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2405_2020064_2020739"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of battery power left on the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2020064">battery level</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2020739">ब्याटरी स्तर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2405_236972_2020735"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of battery power left on the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="236972">battery charge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2020735">ब्याटरी चार्ज</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2405_236972_2020739"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of battery power left on the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="236972">battery charge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2020739">ब्याटरी स्तर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24051_1097914_2027847"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To return to a stable condition after some error has occurred. A program recovers from an error by stabilizing itself and resuming execution of instructions without user intervention.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1097914">recover</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2027847">पुन: प्राप्त गर्नुहोस्</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24057_1098418_1880619"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of statistics that indicates the degree to which a service meets performance, usage, and other demands for the service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1098418">service quality metrics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1880619">सेवा गुणस्तर मेट्रिकहरू</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2407_73729_487366"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In programming, the order and sequence of input and output.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="73729">layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termN