urce that returns a set of search results for a given search query. The source can be a search service in the local server farm or another server farm, or another search engine that is compliant with the OpenSearch protocol.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1636440">result source</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1880824">परिणाम स्रोत</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29149_1506722_2304597"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container for items that are deleted. Items in this container are visible to users with the appropriate permissions and to site collection administrators.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506722">first-stage Recycle Bin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2304597">पहिलो-चरणको रिसाइकल बिन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29193_1644672_1880863"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web Part that renders named objects or named items in a workbook, such as tables, charts, slicers or a named range of cells.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1644672">named item view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1880863">नाम दिइएको वस्तु दृश्य</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2923_59620_487274"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method of specifying software behavior by system administrators. Administrators set policies that are used to control how software features behave.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="59620">Group Policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487274">समूह नीति</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29256_1506853_2304604"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container for items that have been deleted from a first-stage Recycle Bin. Items in a second-stage Recycle Bin are visible only to site collection administrators.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506853">second-stage Recycle Bin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2304604">दोस्रो-चरणको रिसाइकल बिन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29257_1506854_1586496"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A symmetric encryption key shared by two entities, such as between a user and the domain controller (DC), with a long lifetime. A password is a common example of a secret key. When used in a context that implies Kerberos only, a principal's secret key.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506854">secret key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1586496">गोप्य कुञ्जी</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="293_147704_1225222"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A reference to data stored in a document from another program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="147704">remote reference</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1225222">दूर सन्दर्भ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2930_58202_487264"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A category for grouping or describing multimedia or games, such as music categorized as "classical" or "jazz".</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="58202">genre</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487264">किसिम</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">N