 turn-by-turn directions with both audio and visual guidance that changes as the user travels along the route to their destination.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2459049">guided navigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2460563">निर्देशित नेभिगेसन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35716_2065926_2360595"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature where users can add contacts that they call frequently so that they can get to their numbers quickly rather than going through the Contact list in People.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2065926">speed dial</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360595">स्पिड डायल</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3573_73656_487363"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The protocol or protocols operating at a particular level within a protocol suite, such as IP within the TCP/IP suite.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="73656">layer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487363">तह</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote ty