ated with content or items, such as photos or text, to identify certain types of information, and that allows users to find, view, and sort marked content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="359686">tag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488788">नोट ट्याग</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3711_359686_488789"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A marker that can be associated with content or items, such as photos or text, to identify certain types of information, and that allows users to find, view, and sort marked content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="359686">tag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488789">ट्याग</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3712_1814226_2060539"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A telephone conversation between three or more people.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1814226">conference</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2060539">कन्फेरेन्स</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3712_418619_2060539"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A telephone conversation between three or more people.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="418619">conference call</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2060539">कन्फेरेन्स</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37135_2781058_2782451"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for government organizations for OneDrive for Business that includes Office Online, and that is hosted in the commercial cloud environment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2781058">OneDrive for Business with Office on the web (Government Pricing)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2782451">वेबमा Office सहित OneDrive for Business (सरकारी मूल्य)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37147_2108981_2111471"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft's portal site, offering news,  sports, weather, finance, autos, food &amp; drink, health &amp; fitness, autos, travel, weather,   music, videos,  TV, and entertainment &amp; celebrity gossip and shopping.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2108981">MSN Apps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2111471">MSN एप्लिकेसन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3715_39383_487114"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A key that, when pressed in combination with another key, gives the other key an alternative meaning.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="39383">Control key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487114">नियन्त्रणकुञ्जी</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3715_39383_487115"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A key that, when pressed in combination with another key, gives the other key an alternative meaning.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="39383">Control key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487115">CTRL</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3715_39383_487116"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A key that, when pressed in combination with another key, gives the other key an alternative meaning.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="39383">Control key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487116">CTRL कुञ्जी</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3715_39385_487114"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A key that, when pressed in combination with another key, gives the other key an alternative meaning.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="39385">CTRL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487114">नियन्त्रणकुञ्जी</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3715_39385_487115"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A key that, when pressed in combination with another key, gives the other key an alternative meaning.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="39385">CTRL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487115">CTRL</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech"