d, interactive, web-based canvas created using Sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2242119">sway</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2249682">स्वे</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38564_2242146_2249655"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Universal Outlook button which displays, based on the resolution of the device, additional actions that are available for an email such as marking it as read/unread or flagging it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2242146">Organize</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2249655">व्यवस्थित गर्नु</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38579_2242909_2249680"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway menu option that automatically suggests content related to a user's current sway and allows him/her to add it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2242909">Suggested</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2249680">सुझाव गरिएको</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><te