p, save, and share with others.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2308053">map note</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2311149">मानचित्र नोट</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39692_2308053_2311150"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mark or piece of information that you can add to a map, save, and share with others.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2308053">map note</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2311150">नोट</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3972_44091_487145"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A value that is automatically used by a program when the user does not specify an alternative and are built into a program when a value or option must be assumed for the program to function.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="44091">default</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487145">पूर्वनिर्धारित</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39791_2309123_2574763"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An iterative and incremental agile software development methodology for managing product development defining "a flexible, holistic product development strategy where a development team works as a unit to reach a common goal", challenges assumptions of the "traditional, sequential approach" to product development, and enabling teams to self-organize by encouraging physical co-location or close online collaboration of all team members, as well as daily face-to-face communication among all team members and disciplines in the project.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2309123">Scrum</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2574763">स्क्रम</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39791_2856027_2574763"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An iterative and incremental agile software development methodology for managing product development defining "a flexible, holistic product development strategy where a development team works as a unit to reach a common goal", challenges assumptions of the "traditional, sequential approach" to product development, and enabling teams to self-organize by encouraging physical co-location or close online collaboration of all team members, as well as daily face-to-face communication among all team members and disciplines in the project.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2856027">Agile Scrum</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2574763">स्क्रम</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3980_37784_1225819"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To acknowledge an action or the value of some data (e.g. password) by definite assurance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="37784">confirm</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1225819">पुष्टि गर्नुहोस्</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3985_113531_487599"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A handle that supports sizing an object.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="113531">sizing handle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487599">साइज दिने ह्यान्डल</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39850_2312644_2327940"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UI element in Outlook that when clicked will identify and display email where a user has been explicitly mentioned via the @ symbol in either the email subject or body.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312644">Mentions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2327940">उल्लेखहरू</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39851_2312649_2317360"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove a flag.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312649">unflag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2317360">झन्डा हटाउनुहोस्</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39852_2312651_2317353"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A badge for OneNote which when clicked lets users take notes quickly while using any app on the Android platform.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312651">OneNote badge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2317353">OneNote ब्याज</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39853_2312652_2317346"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The act of going to different places on the Internet, on a particular Web site, in a database, etc. in order to find what you want.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312652">navigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2317346">नेभिगेशन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2312654_2317354"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312654">Quick Filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2317354">द्रुत फिल्टर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2312654_2360927"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312654">Quick Filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360927">सन्देश सूचीको लागि द्रुत फिल्टरहरू</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2357846_2317354"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357846">Quick Filters for message list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2317354">द्रुत फिल्टर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2357846_2360927"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357846">Quick Filters for message list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360927">सन्देश सूचीको लागि द्रुत फिल्टरहरू</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39857_2312655_2317337"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that intelligently presorts email across all email accounts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312655">Focused Inbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2317337">केन्द्रित इनबक्स</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39858_2312656_2317344"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu selection that allows users to move emails from the focused inbox into the Other category.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312656">Move to Non-Focused Inbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2317344">गैर-केन्द्रित इनबक्समा सार्नुहोस्</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39864_2322624_2328091"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The wireless personal area network technology, launched in 2010 and marketed as Bluetooth Smart, used for transmitting data over distances as much as 100 meters. Cost and power consumption are low while maintaining a communication range similar to Bluetooth BR/EDR, the other widely-used version of Bluetooth</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322624">Bluetooth Smart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328091">Bluetooth Smart</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39866_2315181_2322310"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Bluetooth Low Energy device that sends static information, such as location or ID, to devices within its area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315181">beacon</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322310">बिकन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3987_141789_1880254"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A placeholder text that included the field character, field type, and instructions, and that that shows where specified information from a data source will appear such that the elements in a field that generate a field's result.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141789">field code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1880254">फाँट सङ्केत</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39877_2315966_2322316"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature for maps of the interior of some public places, such as the businesses inside a mall, or the gates, businesses, and other services inside an airport.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315966">venue map</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322316">स्थान मानचित्र</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316274_2322314"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316274">line-of-business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322314">व्यावसाय विषयक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316274_2322315"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316274">line-of-business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322315">LOB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316275_2322314"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316275">LOB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322314">व्यावसाय विषयक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316275_2322315"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316275">LOB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322315">LOB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39880_2320100_2325708"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for PC and Surface Hub that helps you connect a phone or PC to the Surface Hub display, or to another PC. On Surface Hub, it also allows you to switch between devices that are connected to the Surface Hub.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320100">Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325708">कनेक्ट</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39882_2320437_2322317"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for purchasing cellular data that is packaged with cellular enabled Dell devices that include a Microsoft SIM card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320437">Dell NetReady</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322317">Dell NetReady</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39889_2321509_2325715"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of TV shows that are in the top N% of ratings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321509">Top-rated TV shows</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325715">उच्च मूल्याङ्कित टिभी शोहरू</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39890_2321510_2325709"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of items emphasized to the customer through placement on the site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321510">Featured collections</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325709">प्रस्तुत सङ्ग्रहहरू</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39891_2321511_2325712"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To make your search results more relevant by excluding unwanted and extraneous items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321511">refine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325712">परिशोधन गर्नुहोस्</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39892_2321518_2325711"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows customers to temporarily connect to available free Wi-Fi hotspots in order to find and buy Wi-Fi services from the Windows Store.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321518">paid Wi-Fi services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325711">सशुल्क Wi-Fi सेवाहरू</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39932_2323787_2331586"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To create a sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2323787">sway</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331586">sway</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39933_2323799_2327939"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that lets users link their inbox for one email account with an inbox for another account, so they can see the messages from both accounts in a single place.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2323799">Linked Inboxes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2327939">लिंक गरिएका इनबक्सहरू</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39934_2323812_2327936"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The OneNote toolbar designed to help individuals with learning differences or who are looking for literacy assistance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2323812">Learning Tools for OneNote</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2327936">OneNote को लागि प्रशिक्षण उपकरणहरू</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39935_2324831_2328092"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To install an operating system image on a device, reformatting all partitions as part of the process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324831">flash</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328092">फ्ल्यास गर्नुहोस्</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39964_2325976_2500904"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The enterprise-wide hyper-scale repository for big data analytic workloads which allows you to capture data of any size, type, and ingestion speed in one single place for operational and exploratory analytics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325976">Data Lake Store</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500904">Azure Data Lake Store</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="gramma