e repository for big data analytic workloads which allows you to capture data of any size, type, and ingestion speed in one single place for operational and exploratory analytics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673308">Azure Data Lake Storage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500905">Data Lake Store</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39964_2673309_2500904"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The enterprise-wide hyper-scale repository for big data analytic workloads which allows you to capture data of any size, type, and ingestion speed in one single place for operational and exploratory analytics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673309">Data Lake Storage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500904">Azure Data Lake Store</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39964_2673309_2500905"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The enterprise-wide hyper-scale repository for big data analytic workloads which allows you to capture data of any size, type, and ingestion speed in one single place for operational and exploratory analytics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673309">Data Lake Storage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500905">Data Lake Store</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39964_2673850_2500904"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The enterprise-wide hyper-scale repository for big data analytic workloads which allows you to capture data of any size, type, and ingestion speed in one single place for operational and exploratory analytics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673850">ADLS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500904">Azure Data Lake Store</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39964_2673850_2500905"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The enterprise-wide hyper-scale repository for big data analytic workloads which allows you to capture data of any size, type, and ingestion speed in one single place for operational and exploratory analytics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673850">ADLS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500905">Data Lake Store</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="400_236964_488177"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature of Windows Vista that gives the user quick access to useful information on their computer, such as calendar appointments and the latest email message even when the computer is in standby mode or hibernating, media playback control when the computer is off, and other application notifications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="236964">auxiliary display</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="488177">सहायक प्रदर्शन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40026_2326216_2327935"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Exchange Online Protection that delivers an email without its attachments, scans the attachments for viruses, and then reattaches the attachments to the mail in the inbox.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2326216">Dynamic Email Delivery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2327935">डाइनामिक इमेल डेलिभरी</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40027_2326225_2334440"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that allows users to collect Word, PowerPoint, Excel, Office Mix, and PDF documents as well as sways and publish them on the website, docs.com, where others can view, download or share them or comment on them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2326225">Docs.com</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334440">Docs.com</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40030_2327887_2641143"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web-based interface that is included as part of specialized Windows devices and used by developers to manage device services remotely.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2327887">Windows Device Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2641143">यन्त्र पोर्टल</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40030_2327887_2641193"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web-based interface that is included as part of specialized Windows devices and used by developers to manage device services remotely.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2327887">Windows Device Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2641193">Windows यन्त्र पोर्टल</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40030_2635486_2641143"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web-based interface that is included as part of specialized Windows devices and used by developers to manage device services remotely.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2635486">Device Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2641143">यन्त्र पोर्टल</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40030_2635486_2641193"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web-based interface that is included as part of specialized Windows devices and used by developers to manage device services remotely.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2635486">Device Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2641193">Windows यन्त्र पोर्टल</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4005_44392_487150"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One or more special characters used to separate peers in a delimited structure, at any level (fields, records, and so on).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="44392">delimiter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487150">सीमानिर्धारण</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40063_2329165_2926677"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An image representing the user, visible under their profile</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329165">profile picture</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926677">प्रोफाइलको तस्बिर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40080_2329245_2331585"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that lets a user hide an email message from their inbox, setting it to return to the top of their inbox at a specified date and time. It lets the user clear their inbox by postponing items that aren't urgent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329245">Schedule</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331585">अनुसूची</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40081_2329246_2331506"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To mark an email message or conversation such that it moves to the top of your inbox and is flagged at a specified date and time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329246">schedule</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331506">अनुसूची बनाउनुहोस्</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40082_2329247_2329546"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The combination of enterprise-related hardware and software security features that, when configured together, will lock a device down so that it can only run trusted applications.​​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329247">Device Guard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329546">Device Guard</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40082_2329247_3084875"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The combination of enterprise-related hardware and software security features that, when configured together, will lock a device down so that it can only run trusted applications.​​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329247">Device Guard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3084875">Microsoft Defender यन्त्र गार्ड</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40082_2795844_2329546"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The combination of enterprise-related hardware and software security features that, when configured together, will lock a device down so that it can only run trusted applications.​​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2795844">Microsoft Defender Device Guard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329546">Device Guard</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40082_2795844_3084875"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The combination of enterprise-related hardware and software security features that, when configured together, will lock a device down so that it can only run trusted applications.​​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2795844">Microsoft Defender Device Guard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3084875">Microsoft Defender यन्त्र गार्ड</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40083_2329248_2335669"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section of Windows Store for Business where admins can sign policies and catalogs of approved software, including LOB apps, using enterprise-specific signing certificates.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329248">Device Guard signing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2335669">Device Guard हस्ताक्षर</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40084_2329249_2335671"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category of fonts that make it easier for people with dyslexia to read.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329249">Fluent</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2335671">Fluent</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40085_2329250_2340403"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripG