ive Reader that has large fonts and wide margins, thus creating short lines.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2367633">Short lines</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2369880">छोटो पङ्क्ति</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41826_2368192_2375270"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Excel function that calculates the arithmetic mean resulting from the multiplication of each component by a factor reflecting its weight.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2368192">AVERAGE.WEIGHTED</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375270">AVERAGE.WEIGHTED</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41827_2368193_3038338"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Excel function that returns text that occurs after a given substring in a given string.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2368193">TEXTAFTER</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3038338">TEXTAFTER</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote