oun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42569_2411210_2416737"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ink that results after the user has drawn with a stylus and has lifted up the stylus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2411210">dry ink</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2416737">सुख्खा इंक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42570_2411211_2416738"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ink whose thickness and color can be changed even after drying.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2411211">editable ink</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2416738">सम्पादन गर्न मिल्ने इंक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42571_2411212_2416740"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ink that is retained as dry ink and not converted to a command.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2411212">ink as ink</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2416740">इंकको रूपमा इंक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42572_2411213_2416743"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ink whose look resembles a #2 pencil.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2411213">pencil ink</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2416743">पेन्सिल इंक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42607_2413500_2420901"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office button that launches a task pane where users can research papers by typing queries to get information such as sources, citations, quotes, and images.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2413500">Researcher</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2420901">अनुसन्धानकर्ता</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42608_2413506_2420902"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office feature that allows users type queries and find information, sources, citations, quotes, and images, without leaving the application that they are using.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2413506">Researcher</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2420902">अनुसन्धानकर्ता</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42614_2414369_2417569"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">T​o quickly return to an app, website, or document you were using earlier.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2414369">jump back</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2417569">पछाडि जम्प गर्नुहोस्</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42615_2414370_2417570"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of documents, apps, and websites that, in one click, allows you to pick up your work exactly where you left it earlier, on any device connected with the same Microsoft account.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2414370">jump group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2417570">जम्प समूह</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected<