alNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43060_2439288_2445166"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office Lens feature that uses voice guidance to help users with visual impairments center objects in the frame of their camera when taking pictures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2439288">Frame Guide</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2445166">फ्रेम मार्गदर्शन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43060_2505368_2445166"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office Lens feature that uses voice guidance to help users with visual impairments center objects in the frame of their camera when taking pictures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2505368">VoiceOver</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2445166">फ्रेम मार्गदर्शन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43061_2439289_2445171"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Graph tool that populates a graph from a set of input entities (documents, people, etc.) and the relationships between them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2439289">Sets</term><termNote type="part