ctions related to performance and PC health.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2451802">Computer performance &amp; health</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2453336">कम्प्युटरको कार्यसम्पादन र स्वास्थ्य</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43295_2451803_2453337"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The area of the Windows Defender app for ​family features, linking o the Family tab of the Microsoft account portal.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2451803">Family options</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2453337">पारिवारिक विकल्पहरू</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43296_2451804_2453338"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The area of the Windows Defender app that contains​ Windows Firewall and other network settings.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2451804">Firewall &amp; network protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2453338">फायरवाल र सञ्जाल सुरक्षा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="part