y and enterprise features for added security and device management.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2473564">Microsoft HoloLens Commercial Suite</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2480332">Microsoft HoloLens Commercial Suite</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43905_2475911_2480336"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action or mechanism to explicitly consent to participate in programs or offerings, typically for marketing purposes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2475911">opt-in</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2480336">अप्ट-इन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43906_2475967_2480339"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action or mechanism to explicitly decline to participate in programs or offerings, typically for marketing purposes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2475967">opt-out</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2480339">अप्ट-आउट</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammatica