ected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489910">Email Insights</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44243_2485701_2487386"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The warning that Excel displays when a function cannot be executed because configuration or user settings block certain functionality, such as accessing data over the internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2485701">#BLOCKED!</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2487386">#ब्लक गरियो!</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44245_2485904_2488025"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A website that customers can go to for help with Microsoft products.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2485904">Microsoft Support</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488025">Microsoft समर्थन</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4425_232401_1880356"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Calendar, time status and user defined labels are indicated by colors and patterns.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232401">free/busy time</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1880356">खाली/व्यस्त समय</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44250_2486129_2497574"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In mixed reality, an app view in which the app takes over the full display and becomes the only app you see.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2486129">immersive view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497574">इमर्सिभ भ्यू</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44253_2486136_2497576"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows Mixed Reality​, the desktop app that allows the user to manage their mixed reality headset, get status on their mixed reality hardware, see a live stream of what's visible in the headset, and complete system setup.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2486136">Mixed Reality Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497576">मिश्रित वास्तविकता पोर्टल</term><ter