 to gather information about vulnerabilities or steal login information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2623854">reconnaissance</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2625758">रिकनाइसेन्स</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46620_2623856_2624494"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An attack where an attacker attempts to log in into all accounts across a specific domain using only one password, thus avoiding being locked out of any one account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2623856">password spray attack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2624494">पासवर्ड स्प्रे एट्याक</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46620_2623856_2624495"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An attack where an attacker attempts to log in into all accounts across a specific domain using only one password, thus avoiding being locked out of any one account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2623856">password spray attack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2624495">ब्रुट-फोर्स एट्याक उल्टाउनुहोस्</term