rol added to a window, typically adjacent to the scroll bar, that allows a user to split a window or adjust a window split.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="115534">split box</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="487611">विभाजनबाकस</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50900_2876396_2876468"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service that manages the classification and hierarchical relationships between items such as words, labels, or tags in a system, which includes user-generated and system-generated classifications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2876396">taxonomy service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2876468">वर्गीकरणसम्बन्धी सेवा</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50903_2876995_2877195"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Teams for Education, an activity by which a teacher can assign work to students within a class team.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2876995">assignment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2877195">असाइनमेन्ट</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage"