ificant trends and insights, and allows Natural Language Queries about the data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930012">Analyze Data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930640">डेटाको विश्लेषण गर्नुहोस्</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52044_2930013_2930727"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service of expert assistance that helps very small businesses get the most out of their Microsoft 365 subscription, including migration help, end-user support, and personalized advice from small business specialists.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930013">Business Assist for Microsoft 365</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930727">Microsoft 365 का लागि व्यावसायिक सहायता</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52046_2930015_2930743"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category name for a group of features that enable collaboration with external users in Microsoft Teams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930015">Microsoft Teams Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><ter