bile Alliance - डिभाइस म्यानेजमेन्ट</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52936_3006850_3006988"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The in-browser VPN service built into Microsoft Edge that allows  users to add additional protection by  hiding  their IP address as  traffic is routed  through an encrypted tunnel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3006850">Microsoft Edge Secure Network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3006988">Microsoft Edge सुरक्षित नेटवर्क</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52937_3007291_3007511"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A keyboard layout for Japanese characters that places keys in a 3x4 grid.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3007291">12-key layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3007511">12-की लेआउट</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52938_3007292_3007512"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A keyboard layout for Japanese characters that plac