 Social Impact</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057951">सामाजिक प्रभावका लागि प्रविधि</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53716_3057910_3057952"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A series of games or contests in Microsoft Teams that make up a single unit of competition to promote new learnings and healthy usage of tools and scenarios across the organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057910">tournament</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057952">प्रतियोगिता</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53717_3057911_3057942"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Teams feature that intelligently arranges meeting elements for optimal viewing by automatically adjusting the layout when people join, turn on the video, or present.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057911">Dynamic view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ne-NP"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057942">डायनेमिक दृश्य</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NPL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote ty